Z||000018||Nashco||10-14-2001||04:24 PM||||I love lamborghinis, they are by far my favorite supercars.  My personal favorite is the Diablo VT..baaaaaad cars.  I really like this new one though; it's now a tie!  I love the green paint, and the interior appears amazingly functional, in my opinion.  I think the cooling scoops are a fun idea; get the cooling when you really need it, but look sleek when it's not necessary.  Wouldn't you like to make your body look smoother on command, but still cool adequately? <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Bryce<BR>88 GT||||reg||1
